          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:22befae72902d97ed7d304d600af8c5f9b0f542c193587bc12a55375820ea14b:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_117e6b618c8a4d52b3bd23ce309e2ca6",
      "statement": "EasySAM interacts with three Prismarine submodules: prismarine.prisma_common (cluster loading via get_cluster, path setup via set_path), prismarine.prisma_easysam (DynamoDB table generation via build_dynamo_tables), and prismarine.prisma_client (cluster loading, client building via build_client, and client writing via write_client). EasySAM does not import Prismarine's runtime CRUD layer directly — it is injected into the generated client by prisma_client.build_client.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/easysam/load.py#L11-L12",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:92c069876cc93cde60564f54b898ea921581d1e90503e142f77f04da2a97f233:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/easysam/prismarine.py#L4-L4",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:40c6f8be84996dc56c1948ea1cc2a707c94295ce0e0c9a1f506b34df4eb36bb4:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_3b3ea153df8049288cc8a4173e4a9680",
      "statement": "During preprocessing, preprocess_prismarine resolves conditional-tables via resolve_conditionals, then for each table integration calls prismarine_dynamo_tables which sets prisma_common.set_path(pypath), loads the cluster via prisma_common.get_cluster(base_dir, package), and generates table definitions via prisma_easysam.build_dynamo_tables(prefix, cluster). Generated tables are merged into resources_data['tables'].",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/easysam/load.py#L113-L128",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:527a5eb13dd322036d8229da1d7819903b3d499d554b3e0815d22f89eb8582a9:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/easysam/load.py#L136-L179",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:ba98c9612fb797d3cddbf30a81b44eb7892af42be0847c5432d21f3f404edf04:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_fe644fb7cc59452fa6025cac105f996a",
      "statement": "During preprocessing, if a prismarine.tables entry does not set trigger: true, model-defined triggers are stripped from the generated table definitions (the trigger key is popped). If trigger: true is set, the model-defined trigger is preserved in the generated table definition.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/easysam/load.py#L172-L177",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:ae9f37b6cfc396c1afc047bd33cbf3badef8ee1251807b362e5eecadb18f81c3:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_7985a989f002401a981e06c6a8e19a15",
      "statement": "Client generation in prismarine.py is invoked in generate.py only when 'prismarine' in resources_data, after template rendering. For each table integration, it loads the cluster via client.get_cluster, validates that the cluster prefix starts with the master prefix from resources['prefix'], builds the client via client.build_client with access_module, extra_imports, and model_library parameters, and writes prismarine_client.py via client.write_client if no errors have been recorded for that package.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/easysam/generate.py#L86-L88",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:fe48d10e80b0ab3e53e5d24a829f5b6340b9a4207b1bad9ac935ea510eef9cac:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/easysam/prismarine.py#L7-L58",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:22befae72902d97ed7d304d600af8c5f9b0f542c193587bc12a55375820ea14b:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_f401f6e2131c4d6b92913fd00c6bd692",
      "statement": "A critical integration constraint requires that the Prismarine Cluster prefix must start with the EasySAM prefix from resources.yaml. If the cluster prefix does not start with the master prefix, an error is appended and client generation for that package is skipped.",
      "evidence": [
        {
