    },
    {
      "id": "claim_e9f93b50dcd94e1988b84dc42c7b718d",
      "statement": "The prismarine configuration section supports: default-base (required, directory containing model packages), access-module (default: prismarine.runtime.dynamo_default), modelling (typed-dict or pydantic, default: typed-dict), extra-imports (list of module:ClassName pairs), tables (list of package/base/trigger entries), and conditional-tables (environment/region-conditional table packages resolved via !Conditional).",
